                                <div class="tp-unfold-description">
                                    <div class="tp-unfold-description-inner">
                                        <p>You must be looking for "Bike Mechanic Near Me", " Bike Electrician Near Me"
                                            or "Bike Service Near Me" or "EV Mechanic near me". Well, no more you would
                                            want to search when you Install Bike Service app Apna Mechanic. We bring the
                                            experienced and best bike mechanics at your doorstep to provide you the Bike
                                            Service or any Two Wheeler service at your doorstep within 20 minutes of
                                            booking. </p>
                                        <p>Since electric bikes (EV Bikes) are the new trend and electric vehicles are
                                            booming in India, manufacturers like Hero Electric, Hero Vida, Ather,
                                            Okinawa, Ola Bike and many more are launching their electric bikes and
                                            electric scooters in India. Apna Mechanic covers it all be it Electric Bike
                                            or Petrol Bike. We have expert Bike mechanics, Bike Electricians and EV
                                            Technicians to meet the new demand.</p>
                                        <p> </p>
                                        <p><strong>Looking for Bike Electrician?</strong></p>
                                        <p> </p>
                                        <p>Receive quick, on-the-spot road side assistance for breakdown &amp; starting
                                            problems due to mechanical issues, electrical problems, spark plug issues,
                                            battery-related problems, fuse problems, etc., within 30-40 minutes for your
                                            Electric Bikes from our experienced Electric Bike Mechanic. If the problem
                                            is severe and cannot be resolved immediately, we also offer hauling service
                                            and repair at our bike service center and workshops near you. When you
                                            search for a "Bike electrician near me," we provide the best electric bike
                                            mechanics right on your doorstep who can handle all of the major repairs
                                            under mechanical, electrical, tinkering, and bike painting under experts's
                                            supervision. Do not worry anymore when you are stuck with your faulty EV
                                            Bike; we will send an experienced &amp; professional bike electrician at
                                            home available nearby to assist you faster.</p>
                                        <p> </p>
                                        <p>You don't need to look for qualified bike mechanics and experts because we've
                                            already got you covered for it. All you have to do to get your bike fixed by
                                            booking an online electric bike service using the Apna mechanic app or
                                            website. A qualified bike electrician will come to your doorstep to service
                                            your EV bike at a preferred time and location that works for you. We do not
                                            charge any extra or hidden cost for this doorstep bike repair service. If
                                            there is a serious issue with your bike, it is transparent and will be
                                            shared with you. Apna Mechanic’s Bike electrician at home prevents you from
                                            the inconvenience caused by dealing with the OEM two wheeler workshops or
                                            service centers or the issue of having to pay high motorcycle service
                                            fees.<br />We recommend getting your vehicle properly inspected by a
                                            reliable and authorized electric bike service provider like Apna Mechanic
                                            for long-term benefit after any breakdown repairs have been done.</p>
                                    </div>
